{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43924","headline":"古兴 一 · 赵氏","name":"古兴 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郁蒸夏将半，暑气扇飞阁。\n骤雨满空来，当轩卷罗幕。\n度云开夕霁，宇宙何清廓。\n明月流素光，轻风换炎铄。\n孤鸾伤对影，宝瑟悲别鹤。\n君子去不还，遥心欲何托。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}